==Walkthrough==
===Getting started===
{{Map|name=Sorcerer's Tower|x=2702|y=3405|zoom=2|align=right|caption=The location of the Sorcerer's Tower.|width=220|height=220}}
{{Checklist|
*Talk to [[Thormac]] on the top floor of the [[Sorcerer's Tower]] south of [[Seers' Village]]. {{Chat option|1What do you need assistance with?|1So how would I go about catching them then?|2Ok, I will do it then}} ({{Fairycode|blr}})
*Go to Seers Village and speak to a [[Seer]]. (Wait until the seer is done checking himself in the mirror.) {{Chat option|1Your friend Thormac sent me to speak to you.}} Be sure not to skip this step, as the scorpion in Taverley Dungeon is not accessible without first speaking to the seer.
*Scorpions can be caught in any order and there is no need to return between each catch.
}}

